     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi All,</div><div>I&#39;m very enthusiastic with new html widgets for R and <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399422878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hbEXmUR-rKrF2oTLdo0n2\">shinyapp</a>, as well. So, I&#39;m trying to implementing a simple code but I can&#39;t figure out how to render the htmlwidget on server.R. For instance, I have this output<div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plotOutput(&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">plotGraphics</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;)</span></div></code></div><br>under mainPanel ui.R&quot; to render a simple plot like the code below:</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;plot(getX(),getY(),xlab=input$selectX,ylab=input$selectY,type=&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">o</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;)&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;scatterplot3d(x,y,z, main=&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3D</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">View</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;)&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">..</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></div></code></div><br></div><div><br></div><div>The code is under github on (<a href=\"https://github.com/jbjares/rShiny\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/jbjares/rShiny&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399422878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2itanOiucvJMBeBR47keM6\">https://github.com/jbjares/rShiny</a>).</div><div>So, the point is how can I render the <a href=\"http://www.htmlwidgets.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.htmlwidgets.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399422878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nbAAtpgPaQ6EbIrbLGXvd\">htmlwidget </a>as an output on <a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399422878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hbEXmUR-rKrF2oTLdo0n2\">shinyapp</a>, like is shown under this showcase: <a href=\"http://www.htmlwidgets.org/showcase_threejs.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.htmlwidgets.org/showcase_threejs.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399422878000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2o989ztdIc2pO8tEmyy5FI\">http://www.htmlwidgets.org/showcase_threejs.html</a></div><div><br></div><div>All advices are very welcome.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks in advance.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
