     "<div dir=\"ltr\">You should actually look at the example given by the author of the widget. Look at <a href=\"https://github.com/bwlewis/rthreejs/tree/master/inst/examples/scatterplot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/bwlewis/rthreejs/tree/master/inst/examples/scatterplot&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792399422879000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1h28REnaJvGPzkNscCcgYw\">https://github.com/bwlewis/rthreejs/tree/master/inst/examples/scatterplot</a> and you will found a Shiny example.<div><br></div><div>martin</div></div>"
    ],
